Here a suggestion to the almighty dev team: add some staves to the game.
Those things should be *very* rare but very powerful, too. 
For example, a staff of fire should do 6d6 points of fire damage to
anything within five squares of the staff. 
Staves that confuse, blind, paralyse and so on would be very valuable
in places like the throne room.
 
This thing just crossed my mind the last time I was playing the game.
I met many situations when I was in the same room with a dangerous
monster but I just couldn't harm it with a wand - it wasn't on a 
straight line with me. 
 
 
I would also find it very interesting if humanoids developed
intelligence to some degree. It would be very realistic and nice
if they were able to use wands and staves, too. 
 
